1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:05,140
This dumbass rigged the lottery in five states. And his biggest ticket? Never cashed.

2
00:00:05,740 --> 00:00:08,500
His name's Eddie Tipton, but wait for his job title.

3
00:00:08,880 --> 00:00:13,160
He was actually the information security director at the Multi-State Lottery Association.

4
00:00:14,000 --> 00:00:19,060
That's one office running the damn computers that draw the numbers, for lotteries in many states.

5
00:00:19,740 --> 00:00:23,520
Think of that office as the lottery's engine room, where the drawings actually happen.

6
00:00:23,900 --> 00:00:29,040
And a lottery computer has one job: pick numbers nobody can guess, like a robot rolling dice.

7
00:00:29,680 --> 00:00:33,540
So the security guy rigs it? Double-tap if you saw that shit coming.

8
00:00:34,080 --> 00:00:36,260
Okay, here's the scam, nice and slow.

9
00:00:36,840 --> 00:00:40,920
Step one: he later told a court he wrote code that let him predict the winning numbers.

10
00:00:41,340 --> 00:00:43,480
So he knew the dice roll before anybody threw.

11
00:00:44,200 --> 00:00:46,980
Step two: he said he handed those numbers to other people.

12
00:00:47,640 --> 00:00:50,700
Step three: those people won, and shared the winnings with him.

13
00:00:51,140 --> 00:00:53,720
Send this to whoever still plays every damn week.

14
00:00:54,240 --> 00:00:58,260
Now the big one. In twenty ten, a ticket tied to the scheme hit a jackpot.

15
00:00:58,260 --> 00:01:03,000
The billboard prize? It was advertised at sixteen point five million dollars.

16
00:01:03,380 --> 00:01:07,240
Say you make fifty grand a year. That's three hundred thirty years of your life.

17
00:01:07,980 --> 00:01:09,760
Follow, 'cause guess how much of it got paid.

18
00:01:10,160 --> 00:01:13,600
Not a fucking cent. Nobody ever collected it.

19
00:01:13,880 --> 00:01:17,300
In twenty seventeen he pleaded guilty, which means he admitted it in court.

20
00:01:17,700 --> 00:01:20,160
He was sentenced to up to twenty-five years in prison.

21
00:01:20,760 --> 00:01:23,960
So he rigged it in five states. Still trust the damn lottery?

